<h1>Preferences - Display - Localiser Position</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>Localiser Position settings are used for formatting the co-ordinates of the Localiser Position window:</p>
<p class="whs4"><img src="Images/preferences_localiser_position.gif" width="593px" height="367px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
<p class="sub-head">Digits format group</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Left of decimal</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Number of digits (including leading zeros if enabled) left of decimal point. Significant digits are not limited by this parameter.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Right of decimal</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Number of digits right of decimal point.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Display leading zeros</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Sets whether to display or not leading zeros if the number of significant digits is less than the number set for 'Left of decimal' parameter.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Always display sign</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Sets whether to display or not the plus sign.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Preview</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Shows the representation of the numbers according to the settings in this group.</p>
